    "structure_location": "D03/BiF3 topology, Fm-3m, 16 atoms/cell. Reference lattice from 2014 Table S1 row 4 measured a. Site occupancies are a documented maximal-order approximation enforcing the measured alloy composition, not a published refinement. Si occupies 0.64 of 4a, with Fe on the remaining 4a and all 4b/8c sites. Superlattice intensities depend on unknown order and are approximate; measured peak positions/phase identity are the robust diffraction information."
  },
  "notes": "D03/BiF3 topology, Fm-3m, 16 atoms/cell. Reference lattice from 2014 Table S1 row 4 measured a. Site occupancies are a documented maximal-order approximation enforcing the measured alloy composition, not a published refinement. Si occupies 0.64 of 4a, with Fe on the remaining 4a and all 4b/8c sites. Superlattice intensities depend on unknown order and are approximate; measured peak positions/phase identity are the robust diffraction information.",
